//@ run-pass
//@ expect-stdout: vreg2048_float: PASS
//@ description: #1646 f64 values whose vregs lie far past 2048 (the old NC_IS_FLOAT_REG size) keep their float typing through array get/set, copy and negation
// The padding loop pushes the float vregs of pad_then_float to ~5600 (measured
// with SOUNIO_NV2_IR_TRACE). NC_IS_FLOAT_REG used to hold 2048 entries, so every
// float mark past 2048 was dropped; it is now sized NC_VREG_LIMIT (=IR_MAX_VREGS),
// pinned by scripts/ci/native_capacity_tiers_gate.sh clause 10b.

